WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.269 line:0
主谓一致，讲白了就是先找谁在做事

00:00:04.269 --> 00:00:07.458 line:0
再决定动词用单数还是复数

00:00:07.408 --> 00:00:13.724 line:0
本集不先看离谓语最近的名词，而是先找真正的主语中心词

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.256 line:0
例句请看画面：The students are

00:00:19.256 --> 00:00:21.100 line:0
reviewing grammar.

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:25.879 line:0
先找真正的主语 students，是复数，所以用 are

00:00:25.879 --> 00:00:30.952 line:0
若主语 news 虽然以 s 结尾仍是不可数名词，用

00:00:30.952 --> 00:00:31.537 line:0
is

00:00:31.537 --> 00:00:33.326 line:0
别单看词尾

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.688 line:0
例句请看画面：Neither he nor I am

00:00:39.688 --> 00:00:40.424 line:0
wrong.

00:00:40.374 --> 00:00:44.749 line:0
先看谓语前最近的是 I，就用 am；若最近的是复数

00:00:44.749 --> 00:00:47.374 line:0
parents，则用 are

00:00:47.374 --> 00:00:50.755 line:0
there be 也常看后面最近的名词

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:56.649 line:0
例句请看画面：Tom, together with

00:00:56.649 --> 00:00:59.059 line:0
his friends, is here.

00:00:59.009 --> 00:01:01.822 line:0
先去掉 together with his

00:01:01.822 --> 00:01:05.706 line:0
friends，就只剩 Tom 作中心主语，单数用 is

00:01:05.706 --> 00:01:10.233 line:0
附加短语里出现复数 friends 也不能改成 are

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:15.697 line:0
例句请看画面：The teacher and

00:01:15.697 --> 00:01:17.698 line:0
writer is speaking.

00:01:17.648 --> 00:01:20.792 line:0
先看 teacher and writer 共用一个

00:01:20.792 --> 00:01:24.055 line:0
the，指兼任两职的一人，用 is；若 teacher

00:01:24.055 --> 00:01:27.319 line:0
and the writer 指两个人，则用 are

00:01:27.319 --> 00:01:29.254 line:0
要以语义判断

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:35.305 line:0
例句请看画面：Every boy and every

00:01:35.305 --> 00:01:37.081 line:0
girl has a book.

00:01:37.031 --> 00:01:40.609 line:0
先看 Every boy and every girl

00:01:40.609 --> 00:01:42.399 line:0
每一个都按单数，用 has

00:01:42.399 --> 00:01:46.697 line:0
若句子主语是 students，each 只是补充，就用

00:01:46.697 --> 00:01:47.465 line:0
have

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:53.934 line:0
例句请看画面：A number of students

00:01:53.934 --> 00:01:55.268 line:0
are absent.

00:01:55.218 --> 00:01:57.771 line:0
先看有没有 the，a number of

00:01:57.771 --> 00:02:00.811 line:0
students 指许多学生，所以 are；the

00:02:00.811 --> 00:02:04.336 line:0
number of students 指人数，所以 is

00:02:04.336 --> 00:02:07.468 line:0
of 后的复数别干扰中心词

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:13.220 line:0
例句请看画面：Two thirds of the

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:14.821 line:0
water is clean.

00:02:14.771 --> 00:02:18.107 line:0
先看 two thirds of the water

00:02:18.107 --> 00:02:21.196 line:0
water 不可数，所以用 is；若 of 后换成

00:02:21.196 --> 00:02:23.297 line:0
students，通常用 are

00:02:23.297 --> 00:02:25.586 line:0
不要只盯分数本身

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:31.965 line:0
例句请看画面：Ten years is a long

00:02:31.965 --> 00:02:32.585 line:0
time.

00:02:32.535 --> 00:02:37.173 line:0
先判断 ten years 是不是看成完整一段时间

00:02:37.173 --> 00:02:38.601 line:0
是的话用 is

00:02:38.601 --> 00:02:42.955 line:0
若强调分开的时段，可能用复数，不能见 years

00:02:42.955 --> 00:02:44.587 line:0
就固定选 are

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:51.232 line:0
例句请看画面：My family is a large

00:02:51.232 --> 00:02:51.743 line:0
one.

00:02:51.693 --> 00:02:56.800 line:0
先看 family 当整体，选 is；当成员各自行动

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:59.259 line:0
在英式用法中可选 are

00:02:59.259 --> 00:03:03.362 line:0
police 和 people 表人们通常用复数

00:03:03.362 --> 00:03:05.496 line:0
别按中文集合概念选 is

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:11.868 line:0
例句请看画面：The young are full of

00:03:11.868 --> 00:03:12.427 line:0
hope.

00:03:12.377 --> 00:03:16.048 line:0
先看 the young 指年轻人们，谓语用 are

00:03:16.048 --> 00:03:20.758 line:0
physics 是学科名词，虽有 s，仍用 is

00:03:20.758 --> 00:03:23.574 line:0
区分人群和抽象概念

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:29.341 line:0
例句请看画面：To learn English

00:03:29.341 --> 00:03:30.623 line:0
takes time.

00:03:30.573 --> 00:03:34.676 line:0
先看 To learn English 是一个学习动作

00:03:34.676 --> 00:03:37.021 line:0
整体作主语，谓语用 takes

00:03:37.021 --> 00:03:41.227 line:0
若两个独立活动并列，可能用 are；what

00:03:41.227 --> 00:03:43.139 line:0
从句还要看表语含义

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:48.643 line:0
例句请看画面：He is one of the

00:03:48.643 --> 00:03:51.026 line:0
students who work hard.

00:03:50.976 --> 00:03:54.151 line:0
先看 one of the students，who 指

00:03:54.151 --> 00:03:56.985 line:0
students 所以 work；the only

00:03:56.985 --> 00:04:00.160 line:0
one of…里 who 指唯一那个人，用 works

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:02.634 line:0
不要只看主句 he 单数

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:08.558 line:0
例句请看画面：Many a student has

00:04:08.558 --> 00:04:10.559 line:0
made this mistake.

00:04:10.509 --> 00:04:15.009 line:0
先看 many a student 虽然意思是很多学生

00:04:15.009 --> 00:04:17.259 line:0
形式仍单数，所以用 has

00:04:17.259 --> 00:04:20.259 line:0
a pair of scissors 通常看一副

00:04:20.259 --> 00:04:21.509 line:0
pair，选 is

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.597 line:0
例句请看画面：Both of the answers

00:04:27.597 --> 00:04:28.952 line:0
are correct.

00:04:28.902 --> 00:04:31.798 line:0
先看 Both of the answers，复数用

00:04:31.798 --> 00:04:34.694 line:0
are；Neither of the answers

00:04:34.694 --> 00:04:35.363 line:0
通常 is

00:04:35.363 --> 00:04:39.031 line:0
none of money 不可数，选 is

00:04:39.031 --> 00:04:40.626 line:0
不可机械套一个答案

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:46.700 line:0
例句请看画面：On the wall hangs a

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:47.598 line:0
picture.

00:04:47.548 --> 00:04:50.715 line:0
先看 On the wall 后才出现真正主语 a

00:04:50.715 --> 00:04:53.882 line:0
picture，所以 hangs；换成 three

00:04:53.882 --> 00:04:56.035 line:0
pictures，就用 hang

00:04:56.035 --> 00:04:59.075 line:0
别把句首地点短语当主语

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:04.949 line:0
来看这一道原创练习：A number of trees

00:05:04.949 --> 00:05:07.587 line:0
空 planted every spring in

00:05:07.587 --> 00:05:08.537 line:0
the park.

00:05:08.487 --> 00:05:12.026 line:0
A. is B. are C. was D. has

00:05:12.026 --> 00:05:15.634 line:0
第一步圈 a number of，表示“许多”

00:05:15.634 --> 00:05:19.692 line:0
第二步主语 trees 为复数；第三步 planted

00:05:19.692 --> 00:05:23.750 line:0
与主语是被动关系，完整谓语选 are planted

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:25.737 line:0
正确答案是 B

00:05:25.737 --> 00:05:29.195 line:0
a number of + 复数名词,用复数

00:05:29.195 --> 00:05:32.053 line:0
且被动形式为 are planted

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:37.683 line:0
来看这一道原创练习：She is the only

00:05:37.683 --> 00:05:40.344 line:0
one of the volunteers who 空

00:05:40.344 --> 00:05:41.920 line:0
French fluently.

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:44.278 line:0
A. speak B. speaking C.

00:05:44.278 --> 00:05:46.581 line:0
speaks D. have spoken

00:05:46.581 --> 00:05:50.160 line:0
第一步圈 the only one of，别只看到

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:54.169 line:0
volunteers；第二步 who 真正指单数 the

00:05:54.169 --> 00:05:57.605 line:0
only one；第三步一般现在时第三人称单数用

00:05:57.605 --> 00:05:58.607 line:0
speaks

00:05:58.607 --> 00:06:00.502 line:0
正确答案是 C

00:06:00.502 --> 00:06:03.102 line:0
the only one of...who 中 who

00:06:03.102 --> 00:06:05.028 line:0
指 only one，用 speaks

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:15.012 line:0
做主谓一致，圈主语中心词，排除附加短语，再看就近和意义
